/-- Whenever the function returns a result r, (n + r) mod 3 = 0, i.e., the remainder of n + r divided by 3 is 0.
  Preconditions: s is a byte slice of length n with 1 <= n <= 100000, and for every i with 0 <= i < n, s[i] is either 40 or 41. -/
theorem spec_15 (s : Slice Std.U8) (n : ℕ)
